Z||000000||RedRavenGT||10-05-2001||05:24 PM||||Ok heres the thread that started it all. <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum4/HTML/004551.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum4/HTML/004551.html</A> <P>Now according to the thread this unit is 100% "brand" new right? with warranty? still in the box? and reciept? Am I correct so far?<P>Heres what I got:<P>The deck as pictured. Obviously this deck has been installed before.<BR>No paperwork (manuals but no reciept or warranty from Best Buy)<BR>No remote<BR>No wiring harness plug (cost me $35 more dollars to get one)<P>Now, Im sort of upset about the plug. No big deal though. With the cost included for what I paid for it I got a pretty good deal still right? <P>WRONG!!!<P>Something is seriously wrong with this deck. The tuner doesnt work, CD player only works half the time.<P>Ive been trying for almost 2 weeks to get a hold of this guy to get at least the reciept so I can take it in to get it fixed. That is all I want. I like the deck but not in the working state that it is. Anyone know this person and another way to get a hold of him???<P>Please help.<BR>Scott<BR>D<BR>||||reg||8
