Z||000002||thomas_l||10-05-2001||07:22 PM||||Well... with a little searching it seems stereo boy is a chameleon. He dumped his original name and changed to <B>Blazin_Low02</B> on 9/17.<P>Plugging his clever e-mail choice (guessing S.C. Barton) into SuperPages (last name only) yields 8 matches on the last name Barton in the neighborhood with addresses and phone numbers. Since you did business with him you ought to have his address for a positive match.<P>If you used PayPal or similar you might have some recourse. Otherwise - Hugh Been Screwed. Sue his ass. Or take your next "vacation" in New Windsor, IL.<P>Good luck. It's tough enough to do trade with strangers without a <B>DEADBEAT LUSER</B> like that making it tough for folks to trust  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif">||||reg||8
