Z||000005||Oreif||10-06-2001||02:11 AM||||Go to your bank and get the canceled check.<BR>That will give you his bank account and the name of his bank. Then with that you can get his home address. You can then file against him for mail fraud. You can also work with your bank and his to get the money back. Nice things about checks, they are able to be traced. <P>------------------<BR>            <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg">          <BR><FONT SIZE="1"><B><I>Happiness isn't around the corner...<BR>Happiness IS the corner.</I></B></FONT>||||reg||1
